  "summary": "The 327V...-BN is a compact VAV controller: damper actuator, pressure sensor and flow/pressure controller in one, talking BACnet MS/TP. The BMS writes the setpoint to AO 0 (with SpSource set to Bus) and reads position, actual flow or pressure and status. A bus watchdog drops the actuator to its relinquish default if the BMS stops writing.",
