  "default_device_instance": 1,
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "MV 107 state 4 is printed as a dash.",
    "Sensor 1 objects (AI 8, BI 8) are out of service unless MV 107 selects that sensor type and SpSource is Bus.",
    "Status-flags rows and COV increments are left out; the doc gives COV increments per object."
