  "integration": {
    "summary": "Set SpSource (MV 122) to Bus and write the flow/pressure setpoint as a percentage to AO 0. Read AI 7 for actual flow or pressure, AI 4 for position and BI 0 / MI 104 / MI 109 for faults. Keep writing AO 0 within the watchdog time (AV 109).",
